--[[
	SCRIPT DUMP EXPLORER
	--------------------
	Scans the place for every Script / LocalScript / ModuleScript, lists them in a
	searchable menu, shows the source, and lets you copy one script or all of them.

	HOW TO RUN
	  Option A (easiest):  View > Command Bar in Studio, paste this whole file, press Enter.
	  Option B (plugin):   Save as a Script inside a Folder, right-click the Folder >
	                       "Save as Local Plugin", then run it from the Plugins tab.

	WHY IT MUST RUN IN STUDIO
	  Instance.Source has PluginSecurity. A LocalScript running in a live game gets
	  "The current identity cannot read Source" no matter what you do. Studio command
	  bar and plugins run at an identity that is allowed to read it.

	COPY BEHAVIOUR
	  Roblox has no official clipboard API. The Copy buttons load the text into a
	  TextBox and select all of it for you -- just press Ctrl+C (Cmd+C on Mac).
	  If a `setclipboard` global exists in your environment, it's used directly instead.
]]

--==============================================================================
-- CONFIG
--==============================================================================

